# Street Tycoon - Screen Design Specifications & UI Layouts

Complete layout specifications, component placement, and screen flow designs.

---

## 📱 Screen Specifications

### 1. MAP SCREEN (Zone Selection)

**Purpose**: Display all 6 game zones with unlock status and progression gates

**Layout Structure**:
```
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│ Top Bar (48dp height)           │
│ - Title: "Map"                  │
│ - Settings icon (right)         │
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│                                 │
│  Zone Card 1 (120×120)          │
│  [Lock/Unlock Gate Progress]    │
│                                 │
│  Zone Card 2 (120×120)          │
│  [Gate Progress]                │
│                                 │
│  ... (Grid Layout - 2 columns)  │
│                                 │
│                                 │
│ Bottom Navigation Bar (56dp)    │
│ [Map] [Stalls] [Shop] [Chars]   │
└─────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Component Details**:

- **Zone Card**:
  - Size: 120×120dp
  - Corner Radius: 12dp
  - Elevation: 4dp
  - Layout: Background image + overlay with gate icon (if locked)
  - Badge: Lock icon (48dp) centered if locked
  - Progress Bar: Below card (full width, 4dp height)
  - Label: Zone name + "Zone [1-6]"

- **Gate Progress Components**:
  - Type Labels: "Upgrades: 4/10", "Helpers: 3/5", "Earnings: ₹2000/5000"
  - Progress Bar Color: Gradient green (locked gray if incomplete)
  - Animation: Smooth fill on unlock

- **Top Bar**:
  - Background: Primary color (Green)
  - Padding: 12dp horizontal, 8dp vertical
  - Title Text: Display Large style, white
  - Icons: 24dp size, white color

**Responsive Design**:
- Phone (360dp): 1 column, full width cards
- Phone (412dp+): 2 columns, 8dp spacing
- Tablet (600dp+): 3 columns, 12dp spacing

**Interactions**:
- Locked zone: Show lock icon + toast "Complete [requirement] to unlock"
- Unlocked zone: Navigate to StallScreen with selected zone
- Long press: Show progress details in dialog

