### 2. STALL SCREEN (Main Gameplay)

**Purpose**: Main gameplay loop - tap to serve, earn money, upgrade

**Layout Structure**:
```
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│ Header (64dp)                   │
│ [Back] "Tea Stall" [Menu]       │
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│ Income Display (animated counter)│
│ ₹1,234,567 (+₹50/s)             │
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│                                 │
│  [Stall Illustration] (200×200) │
│                                 │
│  TAP BUTTON (96dp circular)     │
│  with combo counter             │
│                                 │
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│ Helpers Section                 │
│ [Helper 1] [Helper 2] [Helper3] │
│   (48dp avatars in row)         │
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│ Action Buttons Row (full width) │
│ [Upgrade] [Hire Helper]         │
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│ Quick Stats (3-column grid)     │
│ Level | Upgrades | Helpers      │
└─────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Component Details**:

- **Income Display**:
  - Font: Display Small (24sp), bold
  - Format: "₹1.2M" (with K/M/B formatting)
  - Animation: Character flip animation on change
  - Secondary Text: "+₹50/s" in green, smaller font
  - Position: Centered, 16dp below header

- **Stall Illustration**:
  - Size: 200×200dp
  - Aspect Ratio: 1:1
  - Scaling: Fit within bounds
  - Shadow: 4dp elevation
  - Animation: Subtle sway (±2dp, 3s loop) when passive income active

- **Tap Button**:
  - Shape: Circle (96dp diameter)
  - Color: Dynamic (Green → Yellow → Red based on combo)
  - Elevation: 4dp (raised)
  - Shadow: 8dp shadow
  - Glow: Pulsing outer ring (50% opacity, 2dp width)
  - Haptic: Light vibration on tap
  - Animation: Spring bounce on press (scale 0.95-1.0)
  - Combo Counter: Float above button, animated upward +fade

- **Helper Avatars**:
  - Size: 48dp each
  - Border: 2dp accent color (character type color)
  - Badge: Level indicator (16dp circle, top-right)
  - Layout: Horizontal scroll if > 4 helpers
  - Spacing: 8dp between avatars

- **Action Buttons**:
  - Height: 48dp
  - Layout: 2 columns, 8dp gap
  - Width: (screen_width - 32dp) / 2 (minus padding)
  - States: Enabled, disabled (if insufficient funds)
  - Color: Green primary for Upgrade, Secondary for Hire Helper

- **Quick Stats Grid**:
  - 3 columns, equal width
  - Each column: Icon (24dp) + Label + Value
  - Height: 60dp per row
  - Background: Subtle background color
  - Spacing: 4dp between elements

