## 📐 Responsive Breakpoints

### Screen Size Categories

| Category | Width Range | Layout |
|---|---|---|
| **Small Phone** | 360-399dp | 1 column, compact spacing |
| **Normal Phone** | 400-599dp | 2 columns, standard spacing |
| **Large Phone** | 600-839dp | 3 columns, expanded spacing |
| **Tablet** | 840dp+ | 4+ columns, large spacing |

### Adaptive Layouts

```kotlin
// Zone cards: Adjust columns based on screen width
if (windowWidth < 400.dp) {
    columns = 1  // Compact
} else if (windowWidth < 600.dp) {
    columns = 2  // Standard
} else {
    columns = 3  // Expanded
}

// Character cards: Similar pattern
if (windowWidth < 600.dp) {
    columns = 2
} else {
    columns = 3
}

// Helper avatars: Scroll if needed
maxItemsPerRow = windowWidth / 56.dp  // 48dp + 8dp spacing
```

