## 🎭 State Variations

### Button States

```
Default:   
  └─ bg: Green Primary | shadow: 4dp | scale: 1.0

Pressed:
  └─ bg: Green Primary (10% darker) | shadow: 2dp | scale: 0.98

Disabled:
  └─ bg: Gray (50% opacity) | shadow: 0dp | scale: 1.0

Loading:
  └─ spinner overlay | shadow: 4dp | scale: 1.0
```

### Card States

```
Default:
  └─ elevation: 2dp | border: none | scale: 1.0

Hover:
  └─ elevation: 4dp | border: none | scale: 1.0

Selected:
  └─ elevation: 4dp | border: 2dp accent | scale: 1.02

Disabled:
  └─ opacity: 50% | elevation: 0dp | grayscale
```

