## 🎬 Transition Animations

### Screen Transitions
- **Navigate Forward**: Slide in from right (300ms)
- **Navigate Back**: Slide out to left (300ms)
- **Tab Switch**: Fade in/out (150ms)

### Component Animations
- **Button Press**: Scale 0.95 → 1.0 (150ms spring)
- **Card Expand**: Height transition (250ms ease-out)
- **Income Update**: Coin animation ⓐ → ⓑ (200ms)
- **Level Up**: Zoom + confetti (400ms)

